sequenceDiagram
    participant UE
    participant gNB
    participant VAMF as V-AMF
    participant VNRF as V-NRF
    participant HUDM as H-UDM
    participant HUDR as H-UDR / DB
    participant VPCF as V-PCF
    participant VSMF as V-SMF
    participant VUPF as V-UPF

    %% One-slide baseline: real Open5GS services, grouped exchanges.
    %% Expanded reference: full-open5gs-baseline.mmd.

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
    note over UE,VPCF: Registration: all subscription/profile data is fetched at runtime
    UE->>gNB: NAS Registration Request
    gNB->>VAMF: NGAP Initial UE Message
    VAMF->>VNRF: Nnrf_NFDiscovery<br/>UDM for Nudm_UECM + Nudm_SDM
    VNRF-->>VAMF: H-UDM NFProfile
    VAMF->>HUDM: Nudm_UECM PUT<br/>AMF registration
    HUDM->>HUDR: Nudr_DR PUT<br/>AMF context
    HUDR-->>HUDM: OK
    HUDM-->>VAMF: UECM created
    VAMF->>HUDM: Nudm_SDM GET<br/>am-data, smf-select-data,<br/>ue-context-in-smf-data
    HUDM->>HUDR: Nudr_DR GET<br/>AM + SMF-selection subscription data
    HUDR-->>HUDM: subscription data
    HUDM-->>VAMF: am-data + smf-select-data<br/>NSSAI, UE-AMBR, DNN/S-NSSAI
    VAMF->>HUDM: Nudm_SDM POST<br/>sdm-subscriptions
    HUDM-->>VAMF: subscriptionId
    VAMF->>VNRF: Nnrf_NFDiscovery<br/>PCF for AM policy
    VNRF-->>VAMF: V-PCF NFProfile
    VAMF->>VPCF: Npcf_AMPolicyControl POST
    VPCF-->>VAMF: PolicyAssociation
    VAMF-->>UE: Registration Accept<br/>via gNB
    end

    rect rgb(250,250,250)
    note over UE,VUPF: PDU Session: SM data and SM policy are also runtime lookups
    UE->>gNB: PDU Session Establishment Request<br/>DNN, S-NSSAI
    gNB->>VAMF: NGAP UL NAS Transport
    VAMF->>VNRF: Nnrf_NFDiscovery<br/>SMF for Nsmf_PDUSession
    VNRF-->>VAMF: V-SMF NFProfile
    VAMF->>VSMF: Nsmf_PDUSession<br/>Create SM Context
    VSMF->>VNRF: Nnrf_NFDiscovery<br/>UDM for Nudm_SDM
    VNRF-->>VSMF: H-UDM NFProfile
    VSMF->>HUDM: Nudm_SDM GET sm-data<br/>DNN, S-NSSAI, serving PLMN
    HUDM->>HUDR: Nudr_DR GET sm-data
    HUDR-->>HUDM: SessionManagementSubscriptionData
    HUDM-->>VSMF: sm-data<br/>QoS, Session-AMBR, PDU type, static IP
    VSMF->>HUDM: Nudm_SDM POST sdm-subscriptions
    HUDM-->>VSMF: subscriptionId
    VSMF->>VPCF: Npcf_SMPolicyControl POST
    VPCF-->>VSMF: SmPolicyDecision
    VSMF->>VUPF: PFCP Session Establishment
    VUPF-->>VSMF: PFCP Response
    VSMF-->>UE: PDU Session Establishment Accept<br/>via AMF/gNB
    end
